      hu: ["A kanyon 1300 méteres mélységével a legmélyebb Európában.", "A folyó teljes hossza körülbelül 144 kilométer.", "A víz tisztasága miatt 'Európa könnye' néven is ismert.", "1980 óta az UNESCO világörökség része a Durmitor parkkal.", "A híres Đurđevića-Tara híd 172 méter magasan ível át felette.", "A Piva folyóval egyesülve alkotja a Drinát."],
      ro: ["Canionul este cel mai adânc din Europa, având 1.300 de metri.", "Râul are o lungime totală de aproximativ 144 de kilometri.", "Supranumit 'Lacrima Europei' datorită purității apei.", "Parte a patrimoniului UNESCO din 1980 (Parcul Durmitor).", "Podul Đurđevića Tara are o înălțime de 172 de metri.", "Formează râul Drina prin confluența cu râul Piva."],
      en: ["The canyon is the deepest in Europe at 1,300 meters.", "The river has a total length of approximately 144 kilometers.", "Known as the 'Tear of Europe' due to its extreme purity.", "UNESCO World Heritage site since 1980 (as part of Durmitor).", "The iconic Đurđevića Tara Bridge stands 172 meters high.", "Merges with the Piva River to form the Drina River."],
